# E2180 - generated data packages need source-bound tests and semantic output closure
id:                     E2180
trigger_tool:           meson|python|conan
phase:                  testing|installation
error_signature:        no \.po files found in domain directory|not well-formed \(invalid token\)|no element found: line 1, column 0|generated (JSON|XML|catalog).*(empty|count drift)
severity:               2
category:               build-system, testing, packaging, portability
match_keywords:         data-only package, generated XML, empty test inventory, relative test path, XML escaping, record count, final group flush, semantic validation, Meson custom_target
title:                  生成型纯数据包必须同时绑定测试数据根与产物语义闭包
prescan_pattern:        custom_target\(|pathlib\.Path\(\)\.glob\(|outfile\.write\(|install_data\(
prescan_globs:          meson.build, *.py
root_cause:             纯数据项目的测试脚本若按当前工作目录解析相对数据路径，Meson 从 build 目录启动时可能匹配零个输入仍返回成功；生成器若直接拼接 XML 属性、遗漏数据域分支或只在下一组开始时冲刷上一组，还会产出存在但非法、空白或尾组缺失的文件。构建目标数量、文件存在性和测试进程 RC 0 都不能证明生成数据语义完整。
affected_scope:         通过 Python/脚本从 JSON、YAML、CSV、PO 或规范数据生成 XML、catalog、schema、数据库和兼容元数据的 Meson/CMake/Autotools/Conan 包；尤其适用于测试从 build 目录执行、生成器按域分支或按键分组输出的架构无关数据包。
verification_cmd:       meson test -C <build> --print-errorlogs --no-rebuild; parse every generated artifact; compare per-domain output record counts with authoritative source counts; reject empty inventories and zero-byte outputs; run the packaged consumer against the installed tree
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           source-bound-tests-and-semantic-generated-output-validation
rec_description:        测试输入从脚本自身或显式 source root 解析并在零输入时失败；生成器先统一转义目标格式的属性值，逐域覆盖全部声明输入，并在 EOF 显式冲刷最后分组；消费者解析所有生成文件、比对逐域记录数，并验证兼容链接与发现元数据。
rec_command:            resolve test data from Path(__file__).parent; fail when input inventory is empty; parse outputs and assert output_count == source_count for every declared domain
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               upstream-test-patch|generator-patch|test-package
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      disable-unrequired-generated-format-explicitly
fallback_description:   只有上游和包合同明确不安装该兼容格式、没有消费者依赖且元数据同步移除时，才可关闭对应生成目标；不能保留空文件或用存在性检查冒充支持。
fallback_command:       disable the generator in the build-system option and remove the artifact from the declared package contract
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          build-option|package-metadata
forbid_1_pattern:       glob\([^)]*\).*(?!if not)|allow.*empty.*test|tests?.*0 files.*pass
forbid_1_reason:        零输入测试不会触达任何真实数据，成功状态是假绿。
forbid_1_consequence:   编码损坏、缺域和生成器回归可直接进入包。
forbid_2_pattern:       exists\(.*\.(xml|json|mo)\)|is_file\(.*\.(xml|json|mo)\)
forbid_2_reason:        文件存在不证明格式可解析、内容非空或记录完整。
forbid_2_consequence:   消费者在运行期遇到解析失败、空数据或静默丢记录。
principles:             no-silent-skip, provenance-verifiable
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []
doc_file:               doc/E2180.md
last_updated:           2026-09-04
source_event:           iso-codes 4.20.1 Meson adaptation found a vacuous PO test, invalid ISO 3166-2 XML, empty ISO 3166-3 XML, and a missing final grouped record; patched output passed 8/8 upstream tests and 1513 packaged assertions
authors:                2301_80739235
source_pr:
source_commit:
metrics_success_count:  1
metrics_fail_count:     0
metrics_confidence:     1.0
metrics_last_used:      2026-09-04
